No activation, signature, VIN or licensing checks are bypassed by this project.

Native binaries under carplay/bin and androidauto/bin are project-built runtime
artifacts with matching source and build flags. Their hashes are in artifacts.json.
Stock executables are reconstructed locally through small hash-locked deltas.
HMI patchers operate on the owner's exact converted stock JAR; outputs contain
stock-derived proprietary classes and must remain private absent permission.
